# Google AI Studio Master Prompt — EcO Smart Ledger Visual Redesign

## 1. Your Role

Act as a Principal UI/UX Designer, Senior Frontend Engineer, Design Systems Architect, and Quality Assurance Engineer.

You are working on my existing web application, **EcO Smart Ledger**, a personal finance tracking Progressive Web App (PWA) designed primarily for users in Bangladesh.

Your task is to **redesign the existing application's visual presentation and improve its usability directly in the current project**.

This is an existing application, not a new project. You must inspect the current codebase, understand its architecture and workflows, and implement the redesign while preserving all working functionality.

Do not merely generate a design proposal, static mockup, or isolated demo. Update the actual application code.

## 2. Primary Objective

Transform EcO into a premium, coherent, modern, dark-mode fintech application inspired by the provided visual references and the design patterns described below.

The new interface should feel:

- Minimal, clean, and professional.
- Calm and comfortable for everyday financial tracking.
- Information-dense only when the task genuinely requires it.
- Visually consistent across all pages.
- Optimized for mobile-first daily use while remaining excellent on desktop.
- Easy to understand without unnecessary descriptions, badges, decorative graphics, or secondary information.
- Trustworthy, especially when displaying balances, expenses, income, budgets, and personal lending records.

**The fundamental principle is: show the essential information first; reveal detailed information only when the user requests it.**

Do not sacrifice usability or financial clarity to make the interface visually impressive.

