## 12. Implementation Workflow

Work through the redesign systematically.

### Phase 1 — Inspect the project

- Inspect all existing pages, shared styles, components, scripts, and navigation.
- Identify the current color palette and responsive breakpoints.
- Identify duplicated components and inconsistent layouts.
