### Phase 3 — Implement the redesign

Update the existing pages in a consistent order.

Start with shared layout and reusable components, then update each page to use those components.

Keep functional changes separate from purely visual changes whenever possible.

Do not stop after redesigning the dashboard. The entire existing application must be visually consistent.

### Phase 4 — Verify the result

Inspect every modified page and test the affected interactions.

Verify:

- Navigation and routes.
- Add, edit, delete, and save operations.
- Search and filters.
- Financial calculations and balance updates.
- Budget and statistics behavior.
- Wallet and payment-method handling.
