- Mobile bottom navigation and safe areas.
- Floating action button placement.
- Responsive layout at small, medium, and large widths.
- Keyboard navigation and focus visibility.
- No horizontal overflow or covered content.
- No broken interactions or console errors introduced by the changes.

Do not claim that an operation has been tested unless you actually tested it.

